{
  "episode": "ep02",
  "title": "大化の改新はなぜ起きた?〜飛鳥・奈良〜",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 589.247,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 3.755,
          "text": "ねえ先生、どうして蘇我氏は倒されなきゃいけなかったの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 4.055,
          "duration": 5.184,
          "text": "実は、お米と権力がかぎだったんです!乙巳の変から、順番にたどりましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 9.539,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "よし、飛鳥からスタートなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 12.621,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 12.621,
          "duration": 2.539,
          "text": "じゃあ、まずなにから変わったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 15.46,
          "duration": 4.48,
          "text": "6世紀ごろの大和では、豪族の蘇我氏が大きな力を持っていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 20.24,
          "duration": 4.277,
          "text": "仏教をめぐって物部氏と戦って勝ち、力はますます増します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 24.817,
          "duration": 5.024,
          "text": "そして592年、推古天皇が即位して、飛鳥で政治が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 30.141,
          "duration": 1.504,
          "text": "ここからが飛鳥時代です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 31.945,
          "duration": 2.688,
          "text": "蘇我氏は、天皇より強かったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 34.933,
          "duration": 1.355,
          "text": "それくらい強大でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 36.588,
          "duration": 1.355,
          "text": "馬子の子の蝦夷、その子の入鹿は、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b08.wav",
          "start": 38.243,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "好き勝手に政治を動かしたと伝わります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b09.wav",
          "start": 40.953,
          "duration": 2.4,
          "text": "「好き勝手」は、だめなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 43.953,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 43.953,
          "duration": 1.536,
          "text": "そこで登場なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 45.789,
          "duration": 5.515,
          "text": "ええ。推古天皇の摂政として政治をリードしたのが、聖徳太子です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 51.604,
          "duration": 2.016,
          "text": "593年の就任です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 53.92,
          "duration": 3.477,
          "text": "603年には能力で決める冠位十二階、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 57.697,
          "duration": 4.939,
          "text": "604年には政治の心がけを示す十七条憲法を作りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 62.936,
          "duration": 2.069,
          "text": "位は、色でわかるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 65.305,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "ええ、冠の色で位がわかります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 68.336,
          "duration": 4.683,
          "text": "冠位十二階=603年、十七条憲法=604年。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 73.319,
          "duration": 1.717,
          "text": "年号と一緒におぼえましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b09.wav",
          "start": 75.336,
          "duration": 4.213,
          "text": "有力な一族だけの政治から、才能ある人を登用する方向へ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b10.wav",
          "start": 79.849,
          "duration": 1.387,
          "text": "大きな一歩だったんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b11.wav",
          "start": 81.536,
          "duration": 2.517,
          "text": "年号ペアもセットで、覚えたのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 84.653,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 84.653,
          "duration": 2.123,
          "text": "外国とは、どうしてたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 87.076,
          "duration": 5.109,
          "text": "607年、小野妹子を使者に、隋へ遣隋使を送ります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 92.485,
          "duration": 2.155,
          "text": "その国書に「日出づる処の天子、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 94.94,
          "duration": 4.821,
          "text": "書を日没する処の天子に寄す」とあり、中国の史書に残っています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 100.061,
          "duration": 4.843,
          "text": "「日出づる処」って、日本のことなのだ!?対等な感じなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 105.204,
          "duration": 3.125,
          "text": "そう、まさに日本の自立を示す一文なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 108.629,
          "duration": 3.264,
          "text": "また太子は仏教を深く学び、法隆寺を建てました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 112.193,
          "duration": 3.232,
          "text": "現存する世界最古の木造建築として知られています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b08.wav",
          "start": 115.725,
          "duration": 4.48,
          "text": "木の建物が1300年以上、現役なのだ!?すごいのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 120.805,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 120.805,
          "duration": 1.739,
          "text": "太子が亡くなったあとは?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 122.844,
          "duration": 3.872,
          "text": "また蘇我氏が力を持ち、入鹿が専横を極めました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 127.016,
          "duration": 4.885,
          "text": "そこで中大兄皇子と中臣鎌足が、討つ計画を進めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 132.201,
          "duration": 2.496,
          "text": "ここからが、タイトルの話なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 134.997,
          "duration": 6.165,
          "text": "そう、645年、宮中で蘇我入鹿を討ちました。これが乙巳の変です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 141.463,
          "duration": 4.341,
          "text": "二人は、蹴鞠で出会って以来の、信頼の仲だったと伝わります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 146.104,
          "duration": 2.453,
          "text": "ついに蘇我氏、おわってしまったのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b07.wav",
          "start": 148.857,
          "duration": 0.491,
          "text": "ええ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b08.wav",
          "start": 149.648,
          "duration": 3.925,
          "text": "一族の力勝負だった政治を、天皇を中心に立て直す、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b09.wav",
          "start": 153.873,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "大きな転換点になりました。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 156.244,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 156.244,
          "duration": 2.635,
          "text": "で、改新ではなにが変わったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 159.179,
          "duration": 4.661,
          "text": "まず、豪族たちの私の土地と民を、すべて天皇のものにしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 164.14,
          "duration": 2.325,
          "text": "これが公地公民の考え方です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 166.765,
          "duration": 4.832,
          "text": "土地は、戸籍をもとに六年ごとに農民へ貸す班田収授法。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 171.897,
          "duration": 3.605,
          "text": "税は租・庸・調の三つに決まりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 175.803,
          "duration": 3.008,
          "text": "公地公民って、公民館のことなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 179.111,
          "duration": 3.616,
          "text": "いいえ、土地と人も、ぜんぶ天皇のものという意味です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b07.wav",
          "start": 183.027,
          "duration": 3.179,
          "text": "租庸調?授業で聞いたことある言葉なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b08.wav",
          "start": 186.505,
          "duration": 1.472,
          "text": "これ、大事ですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b09.wav",
          "start": 188.277,
          "duration": 3.317,
          "text": "米を納める租、労働の庸、布や地域の特産品を納める調。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b10.wav",
          "start": 191.895,
          "duration": 8.576,
          "text": "公地公民・班田収授・租庸調は、必ずワンセットで!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b11.wav",
          "start": 200.771,
          "duration": 2.091,
          "text": "ワンセット、バッチリなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 203.461,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 203.461,
          "duration": 2.389,
          "text": "そのあとは、すんなり進んだのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 206.151,
          "duration": 3.019,
          "text": "マナブ、壬申の乱は、なぜ起きたと思う?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 209.469,
          "duration": 5.611,
          "text": "天智天皇の死後、大海人皇子が兵を挙げたから、なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 215.38,
          "duration": 4.373,
          "text": "そのとおり!その結果、天武天皇が天皇になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 220.053,
          "duration": 4.597,
          "text": "跡継ぎの対立が爆発して、672年に壬申の乱が起きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 224.951,
          "duration": 2.869,
          "text": "その結果、天武天皇が天皇になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 228.12,
          "duration": 2.432,
          "text": "兄弟でのけんか、かなしいのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b07.wav",
          "start": 230.852,
          "duration": 0.491,
          "text": "ええ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b08.wav",
          "start": 231.643,
          "duration": 2.528,
          "text": "ただ、この乱をへて、天武天皇は、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b09.wav",
          "start": 234.471,
          "duration": 4.075,
          "text": "力を中心に集める国づくりを、いっそう強力に進めたんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b10.wav",
          "start": 238.845,
          "duration": 5.099,
          "text": "中心に力を集める政治を、中央集権と言います。よく使う言葉ですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b11.wav",
          "start": 244.244,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "強い国づくり、つづきが気になるのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 247.575,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 247.575,
          "duration": 2.304,
          "text": "律令国家って、なんなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 250.179,
          "duration": 2.891,
          "text": "律は刑罰のきまり、令は政治のしくみ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 253.369,
          "duration": 3.381,
          "text": "この二つで国を動かす、中国式の国家のことです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 257.051,
          "duration": 3.701,
          "text": "701年、文武天皇のときに大宝律令が整い、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 261.052,
          "duration": 6.965,
          "text": "日本版のしくみが完成しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 268.317,
          "duration": 2.795,
          "text": "藤原不比等らが編集に深くかかわっています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 271.412,
          "duration": 2.784,
          "text": "701年、バリバリ覚えるのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 274.496,
          "duration": 2.699,
          "text": "後に養老律令という改訂版もできますが、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 277.495,
          "duration": 3.168,
          "text": "まずは大宝律令=701年で固めましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b09.wav",
          "start": 280.963,
          "duration": 2.517,
          "text": "国のルールブック、完成なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 284.08,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 284.08,
          "duration": 2.336,
          "text": "国の中は、どう動いてたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 286.716,
          "duration": 2.208,
          "text": "中央には二官八省一台。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 289.224,
          "duration": 5.536,
          "text": "神祇官と太政官の下に、八つの省が実務を担います。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 295.06,
          "duration": 4.341,
          "text": "地方は国・郡・里に分かれ、都から派遣される国司と、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 299.701,
          "duration": 1.707,
          "text": "地元の郡司が管理しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 301.708,
          "duration": 2.795,
          "text": "日本中が、一列に管理なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 304.803,
          "duration": 2.016,
          "text": "そんなイメージでぴったりです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b07.wav",
          "start": 307.119,
          "duration": 5.035,
          "text": "戸籍で人を把握し、六年ごとの班田、租庸調の納税。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b08.wav",
          "start": 312.453,
          "duration": 3.883,
          "text": "全部つながった、当時の最先端システムなんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b09.wav",
          "start": 316.636,
          "duration": 2.912,
          "text": "中央と地方が、まるごとつながってるのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 320.148,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 320.148,
          "duration": 2.752,
          "text": "中国とは、その後もお付き合いなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 323.2,
          "duration": 1.472,
          "text": "隋が滅んだあとは唐。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 324.972,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "630年から遣唐使を送り、制度や技術、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 327.555,
          "duration": 1.963,
          "text": "文化を次々に持ち帰りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 329.817,
          "duration": 6.176,
          "text": "吉備真備や阿倍仲麻呂など、唐で学んだ人が大活躍します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 336.293,
          "duration": 3.029,
          "text": "命がけの海外留学なのだ!えらいのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 339.623,
          "duration": 2.645,
          "text": "ええ、船の航海は大変でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 342.568,
          "duration": 3.957,
          "text": "この交流があったから、日本の制度と文化が一気に進んだんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b08.wav",
          "start": 346.825,
          "duration": 2.624,
          "text": "留学生、日本のヒーローなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 350.049,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 350.049,
          "duration": 2.699,
          "text": "ついに、都のお引っ越しの時代なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 353.048,
          "duration": 5.003,
          "text": "710年、都が平城京に移って、ここから奈良時代です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 358.351,
          "duration": 3.563,
          "text": "中国の都・長安をモデルにした大都市でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 362.213,
          "duration": 2.421,
          "text": "碁盤の目のように町が整然と並びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 364.935,
          "duration": 2.699,
          "text": "弥生の集落とは、規模がまるで違うんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 367.933,
          "duration": 3.061,
          "text": "碁盤の目の都なのだ!迷子にならなそうなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 371.295,
          "duration": 4.533,
          "text": "その整然とした町並みこそ、律令国家の力を見せる顔だったんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b07.wav",
          "start": 376.128,
          "duration": 2.517,
          "text": "都まで整然、さすが国家なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 379.245,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 379.245,
          "duration": 2.219,
          "text": "奈良では、なにが生まれたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 381.764,
          "duration": 4.843,
          "text": "歴史の記録では古事記と日本書紀、和歌の集まりは万葉集。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 386.907,
          "duration": 5.28,
          "text": "国の力を示す仏教では、東大寺の大仏が作られました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 392.487,
          "duration": 5.643,
          "text": "大仏の開眼供養は752年。国をあげての大プロジェクトでした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 398.429,
          "duration": 4.437,
          "text": "大仏、でっかいのだ!?作るの、ものすごく大変なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 403.167,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "宝物を集めた正倉院も有名です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 405.877,
          "duration": 3.147,
          "text": "文化と政治が、奈良で大きく花開いた時代ですね。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b07.wav",
          "start": 409.324,
          "duration": 1.877,
          "text": "奈良、すごい時代なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 411.801,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 411.801,
          "duration": 3.264,
          "text": "でも、うまくいき続けた…わけじゃないのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 415.365,
          "duration": 2.304,
          "text": "さすが、いい着眼点です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 417.969,
          "duration": 6.037,
          "text": "班田もうまくいかなくなり、貴族や寺社が私有地を広げ始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 424.307,
          "duration": 2.517,
          "text": "そこから、また大変化が来るのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 427.124,
          "duration": 4.597,
          "text": "ええ、その種が平安時代に大きく育ちます。詳しくは第3話!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 432.021,
          "duration": 1.472,
          "text": "まずはポイントまとめです!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 433.793,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "まとめ、お願いなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 436.364,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 436.364,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "ここから受験ポイントまとめ!まずは飛鳥時代です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 439.715,
          "duration": 3.285,
          "text": "聖徳太子=冠位十二階603年・十七条憲法604年・"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 443.3,
          "duration": 2.251,
          "text": "遣隋使607年「日出づる処」。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 445.851,
          "duration": 7.872,
          "text": "そして645年、乙巳の変から大化の改新スタート。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 454.023,
          "duration": 5.376,
          "text": "公地公民・班田収授・租庸調のワンセット、忘れないでくださいね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 459.999,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 459.999,
          "duration": 1.92,
          "text": "後半は、律令と奈良です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 462.219,
          "duration": 7.819,
          "text": "壬申の乱672年→天武天皇。大宝律令701年で律令国家が完成。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 470.337,
          "duration": 7.104,
          "text": "二官八省一台、国司郡司、戸籍と班田。遣唐使で唐の文化を導入。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 477.741,
          "duration": 4.853,
          "text": "そして710年、平城京遷都で奈良時代スタート。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 482.895,
          "duration": 6.816,
          "text": "年号は603・604・607・645・672・701・710。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b05.wav",
          "start": 490.011,
          "duration": 1.483,
          "text": "これで完璧です!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 492.293,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 492.293,
          "duration": 2.624,
          "text": "それでは仕上げのクイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 495.217,
          "duration": 7.904,
          "text": "603年、聖徳太子が作った、能力で位を決める制度は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 503.421,
          "duration": 4.416,
          "text": "ア、冠位十二階。イ、十七条憲法。ウ、大宝律令。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 508.137,
          "duration": 2.005,
          "text": "能力で決める…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 510.443,
          "duration": 2.069,
          "text": "正解!冠位十二階です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 512.812,
          "duration": 4.043,
          "text": "憲法は604年、律令は701年と整理しましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 517.455,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 517.455,
          "duration": 0.693,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 518.448,
          "duration": 8.789,
          "text": "645年、中大兄皇子と中臣鎌足が蘇我入鹿を討った事件は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 527.537,
          "duration": 3.776,
          "text": "ア、壬申の乱。イ、乙巳の変。ウ、応仁の乱。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 531.613,
          "duration": 2.837,
          "text": "645年といえば…イなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 534.751,
          "duration": 1.877,
          "text": "正解!乙巳の変です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 536.928,
          "duration": 3.307,
          "text": "このあと大化の改新が始まる、流れで覚えましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 540.835,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 540.835,
          "duration": 0.875,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 542.009,
          "duration": 7.456,
          "text": "710年に都が移された、奈良の都は?ア、平安京。イ、長岡京。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 549.765,
          "duration": 1.749,
          "text": "ウ、平城京。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 551.815,
          "duration": 1.931,
          "text": "なら、なら…ウなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 554.045,
          "duration": 6.112,
          "text": "正解!平城京です。794年に平安京へ移るまで、日本の中心でした。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 560.957,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 560.957,
          "duration": 2.24,
          "text": "今日は聖徳太子から平城京まで、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 563.497,
          "duration": 3.179,
          "text": "日本が「国家」になっていく道のりを見ました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 566.976,
          "duration": 5.749,
          "text": "冠位十二階、大化の改新、公地公民、大宝律令、平城京…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 573.025,
          "duration": 1.92,
          "text": "年号がいっぱいなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 575.245,
          "duration": 2.688,
          "text": "年号がわかると、物語がつながります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b05.wav",
          "start": 578.233,
          "duration": 5.109,
          "text": "次回第3話は、平安貴族の華やかな暮らし〜摂関政治と国風文化〜。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b06.wav",
          "start": 583.643,
          "duration": 0.875,
          "text": "お楽しみに!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b07.wav",
          "start": 584.817,
          "duration": 3.829,
          "text": "つぎは貴族なのだ!チャンネル登録も、よろしくなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sections": {
    "opening": {
      "start": 0.0,
